  "validation": {
    "pch": {
      "minPoliciesPerDUO": 25,
      "minMaxRatio": 0.35
    },
    "spp": {
      "minPoliciesPerCategory": 5,
      "minMaxRatio": 0.005,
      "maxCV": 1.0,
      "excludedCategories": {
        "logicStructures": ["negation_heavy"],
        "predicateCounts": ["none"]
      },
      "comment": "Thresholds relaxed for the 1077-policy two-layer rerun: shrinking flat_singleton to its 7-policy content ceiling (to maximize content diversity for the depth subset) leaves the predicate/set-size 'none' bucket legitimately small (min count 7, min/max ~0.01). These are dataset-generation sanity gates; the SPP privacy verdict itself rests on the multiseed + permutation criterion, not category balance."
    },
    "pi": {
      "minPairsPerType": 0,
      "minSemanticDiversity": 0.55,
      "comment": "minPairsPerType relaxed to 0 for the two-layer rerun: PI Level-III now runs on the stratified depth-layer subset (32 policies x 30 reps) and pairs them at experiment time, so this generation-time estimate of semantic_equivalent/structural_variant pairs across the full 1077-policy pool no longer gates the design. The PI privacy verdict rests on the multiseed + permutation criterion. Estimate sampling is also seeded (see validator) for deterministic validation."
    }
  },
  "notes": [
    "This configuration emits ~315 policies with dedicated layers for SPP balance (including nesting depth) and a PI-focused structural variant stage.",
    "logicStructure is classified at the author level (logicOriginal): predicate bindings like (DS & P[ICD10]) are atomic units, so or_only policies remain or_only after normalization. nestingDepth stays execution-level (logicNormalized).",
    "ensureMixedOperators (medium_nesting_focused, deep_nested_large) guarantees at least one AND and one OR junction in 3+ term combos, deterministically feeding the author-level and_or_mixed bucket.",
    "Per-layer logicOptions and whitelist buckets steer DUO V3-valid and_only / or_only / and_or_mixed logic plus balanced nesting depths.",
    "Legacy GR input aliases are canonicalized to GRU; DUO:0000046 is NCU (non-commercial use only), not commercial use.",
    "The production circuit is PolicyPrivacyMain(13, 11, 64, 5, 8, 32); NOT is intentionally excluded.",
    "Predicate count distribution: none(50, 17%), single(76, 26%), few(118, 40%), many(50, 17%) - ratio 0.424, CV 0.378",
    "deep_nested_large layer uses 4-5 predicate combos (15-19 tokens) to populate 'many' category for complete SPP validation.",
    "medium_nesting_focused layer specifically targets maxDepth=3 policies to balance the nesting depth dimension.",
    "Policy counts have been adjusted to ensure min/max ratio ≥ 0.25 and CV ≤ 0.65 for all SPP dimensions.",
    "The structural_variants layer locks logic per combination and emits 4 structure-only + 2 padded execution variants, which the validator now scales to estimate total PI pairs.",
    "Semantic similarity incorporates ICD/OBI/population/geo/clinical scopes and layer variants so average diversity reflects true ontology coverage.",
    "IMPORTANT: Use artifacts compiled from the production DEPTH=64 circuit before executing this configuration.",
    "Recommended usage:",
    "  1. Recompile circuit: cd circuits && circom policy_privacy_main_instance.circom --r1cs --wasm --sym -o build/",
    "  2. Validate config: node experiments/capture/validator.js --config=experiments/capture/configs/unified_dataset_config_optimized.json"
  ]
